
This directory contains two executable scripts and associated files for
testing the ddpt and ddpt_sgl utilities.

Files:
    prepare.sh             test script for ddpt. With no arguments checks if
                           (dummy) storage is in place to run various copies.
                           The copies are done if --run option is given
    ram0_2_ram1.jf	   job file use by prepare.sh
    ram1_2_sg_a.jf	   job file use by prepare.sh
    sd_b_2_sd_a.jf         job file use by prepare.sh
    sg_a_2_sg_b.jf         job file use by prepare.sh
    sgl_1.jf               job file use by prepare.sh
    sgl_ls10_cont.txt      scatter gather list invoked by sgl_1.jf skip=
    sgl_ls10_cont_hex.txt  scatter gather list invoked by sgl_1.jf seek=
    test_sgl.sh            test script for ddpt_sgl
    urand_ram0.jf          job file use by prepare.sh
